# Pharmacy Capabilities

## Business Management

A pharmacy user should be able to:

- Register a pharmacy business.
- Submit business verification documents.
- Update business information.
- View verification status.
- Respond to verification requests.
- Manage pharmacy profile.
- Manage business settings.
- Manage delivery addresses.
- Configure business preferences.
- Manage pharmacy staff.
- Invite staff members.
- Remove staff members.
- Assign staff permissions.
- View business activity.

---

## Stockist Discovery

A pharmacy user should be able to:

- Search for stockists.
- Browse available stockists.
- View stockist business information.
- View stockist catalogue availability.
- Request a business connection.
- View pending connection requests.
- Cancel a connection request before approval.
- View connected stockists.
- Disconnect from a stockist if business rules permit.

