# Capability Rules

Every capability defined in this document must eventually have:

- One or more business rules.
- One or more workflows.
- One or more acceptance criteria.
- Defined permissions.
- Defined dependencies.
- Defined edge cases.

Capabilities should never directly describe implementation.

Implementation belongs to later sections of the Product Definition Document.

---

# Completion Criteria

This section is considered complete only when every meaningful action that every user can perform within DigiSwasthya has been explicitly defined.

Future sections will describe exactly how each capability behaves under every possible business condition.